  "question": {
    "text": "If the total number of positive integral solutions of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>20</mn></math> is <math><mi>k</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to"
  },
